OL,3,GNEWSAVictims and veterans keeping close
OL,4,Awatch on Troubles legacy bill debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FLegislation seeking to deal with the
OL,7,Funresolved legacy of the decades-long
OL,8,Fviolent conflict in Northern Ireland is
OL,9,Ffinally making its way through
OL,10,FWestminster.
OL,12,FThe Troubles legacy bill returned to
OL,13,Fthe House of Commons on Monday and MPs
OL,14,Fwill continue their scrutiny of a
OL,15,Fseries of government amendments on
OL,16,FTuesday.
OL,18,FThe long-awaited legislation will have
OL,19,Fa wide-ranging social impact, and
OL,20,Faffect almost everyone, but especially
OL,21,Fvictims' families and military
OL,22,Fveterans.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
