OL,3,GNEWSAVictims and veterans keeping close
OL,4,Awatch on Troubles legacy bill debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor people like Patricia Burns, whose
OL,7,Ffather was shot dead by a soldier, and
OL,8,FDavid Crabbe, who served in the Ulster
OL,9,FDefence Regiment during the Troubles,
OL,10,Fthe debate is especially important.
